# HDZERO_HALO defaults.parm
# ExpressLRS (CRSF) on SERIAL1 (USART1 PB6/PB7) with RC input.
# Use RC_OPTIONS bits 9 (suppress CRSF mode/rate message) and 13 (ELRS 420k baud).
# Bit positions: 9 => 512, 13 => 8192, combined => 8704.
# We start SERIAL1_BAUD at 115 (115200). ELRS will negotiate and RC_OPTIONS bit 13
# allows the 420k transition automatically without user intervention.
# Provide robust defaults for RSSI/LQ reporting and flight mode channel mapping.

SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 23
SERIAL1_BAUD 115
RSSI_TYPE 3
RC_OPTIONS 8704
FLTMODE_CH 12

# Barometer fully disabled in hwdef (AP_BARO_ENABLED 0) so no BARO_* params here.
# Users can override any of these via Mission Planner as usual.
